<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>SkillExchange — Share skills, find help</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="landing">
    <nav class="landing-nav">
      <a href="/" class="sidebar-logo" style="padding:0">
        <span class="logo-mark">✦</span> skillexchange
      </a>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.75rem;align-items:center">
        <a href="/auth?mode=login" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Log in</a>
        <a href="/auth?mode=signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Join community</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="landing-hero">
      <h1>Your next useful conversation is out there.</h1>
      <p>Join a thoughtful community where people trade skills, context, experience, and a little momentum.</p>
      <div class="landing-actions">
        <a href="/auth?mode=signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get started</a>
        <a href="/auth?mode=login" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Sign in</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-num">1</div>
        <h3>Create your profile</h3>
        <p>Tell the community what you can help with and what you need help with.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-num">2</div>
        <h3>Discover people</h3>
        <p>Search by skill and see who in your cohort you can help and who can help you </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-num">3</div>
        <h3>Request &amp; respond</h3>
        <p>Send a short request. They accept or decline. You both stay in the loop and you keep making new and vibrant connections</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
